# VITE_ADMIN_PASSCODE: passcode required to unlock the Admin Portal (Leads Vault)
# that lists client inquiries (name, email, phone). Set a strong, unique value
# per deployment. If unset, the Admin Portal is disabled (fail closed).
#
# IMPORTANT: this is a client-side-only deterrent, not real access control —
# whatever value you set here ends up inside the shipped JS bundle and can be
# read by anyone who opens browser devtools. It stops casual visitors from
# browsing/deleting leads through the UI; it does not stop a determined
# attacker. For real protection, move lead storage behind an authenticated
# backend instead of localStorage.
VITE_ADMIN_PASSCODE="change-me"
